# Create Dummy Data and Expand HOD Dashboard Columns

## Goal Description
The goal is to enhance the system by creating realistic dummy data for testing and demonstration purposes. Specifically, we will generate 10 mock entries for each of the 4 applicant categories (`Group A Officer`, `Teaching Staff`, `Non-Teaching Staff`, and `Research Scholar`). These entries will cover different application statuses (Pending, Approved, Reapply Requested, Provisioned). 
Additionally, we will expand the HOD Dashboard table to display more detailed information from the applicant's submission, making use of the recently added horizontal scrollbar.

## User Review Required
> [!IMPORTANT]
> Please review the additional columns that will be added to the HOD dashboard. Let me know if you want any specific columns prioritized or omitted.

